<title>TURKEY: Turkey raises petrol prices by five percent.</title>
<headline>Turkey raises petrol prices by five percent.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey raised petrol prices by five percent on Friday with immediate effect, state-run Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>It said the price of super grade petrol was raised to 66,080 lira in Ankara from 62,920. Petrol prices vary in Turkey depending on the distance from oil refineries.</p>
<p>Petrol prices were last raised Aug 22.</p>
</text>
